Update the script to create the branch from main or --origin parameter. add parameters for --project-dir and --branch 

```bash
#!/bin/bash
PROJECT_DIR=$1
BRANCH_NAME=$2


WORKTREE_PATH=${PWD}/branches/${BRANCH_NAME}


mkdir -p ${WORKTREE_PATH}


cd ${PROJECT_DIR}


git worktree add "${WORKTREE_PATH}" "${BRANCH_NAME}"

```
